  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "人工智慧",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE",
    "describe_ch": "人工智慧(AI)帶來的科技典範轉移，已是無法抵擋的潮流，因此認識AI乃至利用AI，便成為現代學生必需擁有的知能。本課程將介紹AI人工智慧的發展，並釐清AI、機器學習(ML)與深度學習的異同。課程同時介紹ML處理問題的流程步驟，並引導同學以ML流程架構來解決生活與專業領域所遭遇的問題。最後，藉由TensorFlow的介紹與實作，同學將可更進一步了解ML，以及打好後續進階課程的基礎。",
    "describe_eh": " Artificial intelligence (AI) has brought an inevitable technology paradigm shift, which is also a necessity for the students to acquire the skills in utilizing AI. This course introduces the development of AI and explains the difference between AI and machine learning (ML). Further, ML is discussed in details with examples to solve problems in people’s daily life or in professional fields. Finally, implementation of TensorFlow is introduced to help students understand ML in depth and also helps the students get ready for exploring further topics of AI.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "了解甚麼是AI人工智慧，並能區分AI、機器學習(ML)與深度學習的異同",
      "describe_en": "Understand AI and be able to distinguish the difference between AI and ML."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "了解ML處理問題的流程步驟，並練習如何將生活/專業領域遭遇的問題，以ML流程架構解決",
      "describe_en": "Understand the process utilizing ML to solve problems and practice to formulate the problems in daily life/professional fields."
    }
  ],
